iOS UI haptics (CoreHaptics, UIFeedbackGenerator, keyboard taps, the unified vibe engine) on the
PM8350B LRA. negronihap_ui=1 (needs negronihap=1|2): NegroniVibrator publishes
IODeviceTree:/product/haptics closed-loop = 1 (D22 values; MobileGestalt
DeviceSupportsClosedLoopHaptics), and bsd/dev/negroni_haptic_ui.c makes /dev/negroni-haptic: the
samples iOS plays on the HAL "Actuator" device (NegroniAudio.driver) become the direct-play
amplitude of patch 0300 (2 ms block peaks, 8 ms hold, HackiOS strength curve, tap >= 20 ms). Also the Linux
CAL_EN RC-clock toggle when a play forces VREG_RDY (hBoost kept on).
Details: docs/haptics-plan.md section 8.

